    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64099b63a81a3e5a73d05e21",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我的目标是达成即使在国外GⅠ中，\n也被认为不可能办到的壮举。换句话说──",
      "source_fingerprint": "462ce9c5d8237fc6abb7bdf70e00bb2b60ca83aab4b2ab33538ec2ff2ada1b50",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
