      "uid": "zhcn:cc3773e43ef7aeeda7b1474b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我的灵魂是这么说的……\n“拿下首次欧洲GⅠ胜利，\n才是我命中注定要实现的目标！”",
      "source_fingerprint": "40a08ff6bcea310c15f2d7d49f2e622c98117f8eb23c1f6c5a1cc2e52a0bd35c",
