      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "采珠似乎就是如此渴望拿下欧洲GⅠ胜利。\n渴望到让她甚至觉得……这是命中注定。",
      "source_fingerprint": "431a49134d217f0873d4af669364beb16982e6f8d289beb5efe0e9456ebb5898",
