      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我把这当成目标OK吧？\n不过，虽然一言以蔽之地说了欧洲GⅠ，\n但其中也是分成了很多种距离呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "46dcdf0364ba8e4680c9ee8af33b54ae7af5e2ba6b0fa61e32f43ac4bd4ae896",
